  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC_Description
  lines:
  - "One of the boat\u2019s special guests who had been personally invited by the CEO. She is secretly the CEO\u2019s mistress and has been stealing from him. Many of his belongings can be found in her cabin or on her person throughout the course of the game. She is materialistic, arrogant and a flirt. \r\n"
